            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method and device for picture encoding and decoding enable a cross-component dependent tool for a chroma block only when the block and at least one co-located luma block are contained within respective rectangular areas, and apply a scaling factor derived from neighboring reconstructed luma samples to the chroma residual</p>
